# A seventh Russian story: Tom's trip
subtitle: "Read Tom's note from his trip to Petersburg, thirteen lines built from lessons 1–69 with glosses only on unit seven's verbs: leaving and arriving, walking and riding, must, if and would. Hear it line by line, test yourself by eye and by ear, say a line, and look back at unit seven."
tags: ["russian","russian reading","russian story","verbs of motion","russian a2"]
teaches: ["reading/reading-stories","grammar/verbs-of-motion"]
thumb: "band \"A seventh story: Tom's trip\" note \"lessons 61–69, 13 lines\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Clothes in Russian: в кра́сной ку́ртке","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/71-russian-clothes.cast"}

## A seventh Russian story: Tom's trip
level: basic
heading: false

    glossed s1 "Приве́т, Ма́ша! Я уе́хал в Петербу́рг." say_voice a gloss ["","","","left (for)","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s2 "Я е́хал на по́езде четы́ре часа́." say_voice a gloss ["","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s3 "Сосе́д сказа́л: «Я учу́сь в Петербу́рге»." say_voice a gloss ["neighbour","said","","study","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s4 "Он сказа́л, что тут лу́чше, чем в Москве́!" say_voice a gloss ["","","that","","","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 990 font_size 44 hidden true
    glossed s5 "Ве́чером я прие́хал в гости́ницу." say_voice a gloss ["","","arrived","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s6 "Но́мер, в кото́ром я живу́, о́чень ма́ленький." say_voice a gloss ["","","which","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 990 font_size 44 hidden true
    glossed s7 "В Москве́ я е́зжу на метро́, а тут хожу́." say_voice a gloss ["","","","ride","","","","","walk"] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 640 width 990 font_size 42 hidden true
    glossed s8 "Тут есть парк, кото́рый мне о́чень нра́вится." say_voice a gloss ["","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 490 width 990 font_size 42 hidden true
    glossed s9 "Е́сли бу́дет тепло́, я пойду́ в парк." say_voice a gloss ["if","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 340 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s10 "А е́сли бу́дет хо́лодно, я прочита́ю кни́гу." say_voice a gloss ["","","","","","will read",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 190 width 990 font_size 44 hidden true
    glossed s11 "В суббо́ту я до́лжен быть в Москве́." say_voice a gloss ["","","","must","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s12 "Я хоте́л бы жить тут ле́том!" say_voice a gloss ["","","would","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s13 "А ты е́здила в Петербу́рг? Напиши́ мне!" say_voice a gloss ["","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 990 font_size 44 hidden true
